meta {
  name: 8c. Sell Claim (Blocked if NOT DELIVERED)
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/escrows/{{escrowId}}/sell
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "requested_by": "acc_seller_001",
    "settlement_notes": "Attempting sell while escrow is in FUNDED state"
  }
}

docs {
  **Sell Claim Blocked Test**: Attempts to call `POST /sell` on an escrow that is in `FUNDED` or `CREATED` state (not yet marked `DELIVERED`).
  
  **Expected Result**:
  - `HTTP 400 Bad Request`
  - Error Detail: *"Cannot release/sell escrow in 'FUNDED' state. Escrow MUST be marked 'DELIVERED' before funds can be released to the seller."*
}
